<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Young Justice: Facets</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Two months after a crisis on Apokolips brought together the young heroes of Earth and Etheria, both groups are struggling to adjust to the new status quo. But Catra's discomfort with life on her new home and an interstellar long-distance relationship may soon seem quaint in comparison, when the Light's latest scheme threatens to overthrow the Cosmic Balance between Order and Chaos.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Direct sequel to She-Ra &amp;amp; the Shadow of Apokolips&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>DrAlgae</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
